<title>POLAND: Jelfa says safe from flood.</title>
<headline>Jelfa says safe from flood.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish drug maker Jelfa SA said in a statement on Monday it had suffered no loss from the two-week-old flood that ravaged southern Poland.</p>
<p>Jelfa is based in the southwestern province of Jelenia Gora which has been particularly badly affected.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
